=== WEB SOURCE (the specification) ===
  features/notifications/components/ComputedMetricEditor.tsx — a CONTROLLED operand editor for
  kind='computed_metric' alert rules, used inside AlertStudioPage. Props are narrow: `{ value, onChange, metrics,
  loading }`; the parent owns the editor state and the component owns only the live-preview cache. Composition:
    metric  <Select>  : options from the metrics registry (web useAlertMetrics); placeholder "Choose a metric"
                        ("Loading metrics…" while loading); onChange → handleMetric (defaults window+operator).
    window  <Select>  : options from the selected metric's windows; disabled until a metric is chosen.
    operator<Select>  : options from selected.ops ?? ALL_OPS; disabled until a metric is chosen.
    threshold <Input> : type=number, step=any; kept as the RAW STRING for parity with the rest of the editor.
    live preview <GlassPanel> : a useEffect re-fires usePreviewComputedMetric (POST /alerts/test,
                        kind='computed_metric') whenever metric/window/op/threshold change AND `ready`; renders
                        idle / "Computing…" / error / "Right now this metric is {{value}}{{suffix}} — would
                        {{verdict}} fire." with verdict = would('') / wouldNot('NOT') and fmtNumber(value,2).
  Helpers ported verbatim: opLabel · opKey · unitSuffix · the `ready` predicate · parseFloat+isFinite ·
  handleMetric (first-window / first-op defaults) · the suffix-with-leading-space · the previewValue interpolation.

