=== STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces) ===
  Registry (metric select) — source = useAlertMetrics:
    loading  → spinner + "Loading metrics…"                              (ComputedMetricRegistryPresentation.loading)
    content  → empty-choice-prepended options; live/stale/offline chip    (.content)
    empty    → resolved but none → choose-only select + "No metrics available yet."  (.empty)
    error    → inline "Couldn't load metrics" + Retry (retryable)         (.error)
    stale    → amber stale chip on loaded options                         (.content/.stale)
    offline  → cached options + offline chip, OR (no cache) offline + Retry (.content/.offline / .offlineNoData)
  Live preview — source = usePreviewComputedMetric:
    idle     → "Pick a metric, window, operator, and threshold to preview." (not ready)
    computing→ spinner + "Computing…"                                       (phase .computing)
    error    → the mutation error message (rose)                           (phase .failure)
    value    → "Right now this metric is X{suffix} — would [NOT] fire."     (phase .success)
    offline  → last successful preview kept behind an offline chip          (offline w/ cache)
    stale    → stale chip when the last preview ages past the window        (injected-clock staleness)
  Resolver + preview lifecycle unit-tested across ALL branches.

